constructor
  ├── it should set the Comet
  ├── it should set the CometRewards
  ├── when vault is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when Comet is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when CometRewards is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__NoZeroAddress
  └── when Comet's base token does not match the vault asset
      └── it should revert with ProtocolAdapter__AssetMismatch
